<title>ITALY: Bank of Italy sets 8.5 trillion lire repo tender.</title>
<headline>Bank of Italy sets 8.5 trillion lire repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy said it called an 8.5 trillion lire repurchase tender for today for government securities to be resold on August 1.</p>
<p>At the previous six-day operation for 10.0 trillion lire on July 8, the minimum accepted rate stood at 6.93 percent and the average rate at 6.96 percent.</p>
